=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play system-details/alpine323 --------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's System Details screen$
# (pkg/screens/systemdetails), inferred from origin/main$
# (unreleased), read from a simulated host by the real reader$
# (pkg/engine/details). It only reads: no plan, no y/N, no$
# journal. Nothing on this machine changes: every command and$
# file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: system-details/alpine323$
# web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23.6, as the 2026-10-21 VM$
# (vmtest.md §8.6): kernel 6.18.53-0-virt, doas. It has no$
# lslogins or lastlog, /var/log/wtmp and /run/utmp stay at 0$
# bytes after a terminal login, and BusyBox's last -n 1 alice$
# prints its usage and fails; sshd's own lines go to$
# /var/log/messages, 0640 root wheel (vm-runs/s1/01-tools.log,$
# 08-lslogins.log, 09-lslogins-blank.log). So one row says so.$
$
